factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The article says the protest was led by Kanimozhi under Stalin's instruction, and that Gowri presided, but the reel_script and caption say Kanimozhi led it; the article's wording is ambiguous, and the draft's 'கனிமொழி தலைமையில்' sentence conflicts with 'அமைப்பாளர் கவுரி தலைமை வகித்தார்' as a second presiding role not clearly stated in the source.
  The article's ARTICLE text is cut off, so 'நாமக்கல் தி.மு.க. தலைவர் ஸ்டாலின்' is presented as Namakkal DMK leader, but the article says 'தலைவர் ஸ்டாலின் ஆணைக்கிணங்க' (on the instruction of party president Stalin); the draft mislabels Stalin as the Namakkal DMK head.
  The draft's Tamil headline and reel_script say the protest was held in Namakkal town, but the article only mentions Namakkal district (east and west districts); the specific location 'நாமக்கல்' is not clearly stated as the protest venue.
  The reel_script omits the article's key distinction that the event was organized by the district-level units covering Namakkal east and west districts; it only mentions attendees generically, dropping the source's full attribution.
